            "chunk_id": 266,
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "content": "# People handbook\n\n## Annual leave\nFull-time employees receive 18 working days of annual leave per calendar year. Requests go through the staff portal and need manager approval before travel is booked. Unused days may roll over only up to five days into the next year. The People team answers questions about balance corrections. This paragraph defines the annual leave rule; it does not define contractor benefits."
          }
        ],
