            "chunk_id": 270,
            "chunk_index": 0,
            "content": "# Security standard\n\n## Multi-factor authentication\nAll staff must enable multi-factor authentication on the corporate identity account. Hardware security keys are preferred for privileged administrators. Recovery codes belong in the approved password manager, never in a shared chat room. The service desk can reset a lost factor only after an identity check. This rule covers corporate sign-in and does not specify personal device passwords."
          }
        ],
