            "chunk_id": 272,
            "chunk_index": 2,
            "content": "register is the evidence for auditors. A review is required even if no role changed during the previous quarter.\n\n## Incident reporting\nA suspected security incident must be reported to the security duty channel within 30 minutes of discovery. The first report includes the time, affected service and observed symptom; it should avoid copying customer secrets. The security lead assigns severity and coordinates containment. Staff should preserve relevant evidence instead of deleting suspicious files."
